---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
const contactEnabled = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_CONTACT_ENABLED === 'true';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Notice | Prather Software"
  description="How Prather Software handles website visits and contact inquiries, including Cloudflare Turnstile and Google Workspace email processing."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Privacy"
    title="Clear about what you share."
    description="This notice describes the website’s current configuration and how contact inquiries are processed."
  />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose privacy-copy">
      <h2>Website visits</h2>
      <p>
        This website does not include advertising trackers or analytics scripts.
        The hosting provider may process technical information such as IP
        addresses and request metadata to serve the website, maintain security,
        and diagnose errors.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact inquiries</h2>
      {contactEnabled ? (
        <p>
          The inquiry form requests your name, email address, inquiry category,
          and message so Prather Software can review and respond. Do not submit
          passwords, payment details, or sensitive personal information.
        </p>
      ) : (
        <p>
          The public inquiry form remains disabled while sender authorization
          and delivery verification are completed. No inquiry data is
          transmitted while it is disabled. Once enabled, it will request your
          name, email address, inquiry category, and message so Prather Software
          can review and respond. Do not submit passwords, payment details, or
          sensitive personal information.
        </p>
      )}
      <p>
        The contact service validates submissions on the server and uses
        Cloudflare Turnstile to help prevent abuse. Accepted inquiries are sent
        through the Gmail API to Prather Software’s Google Workspace mailbox.
        Submission success means Gmail accepted the message; it does not
        guarantee inbox delivery.
      </p>
      <h2>Service providers and security</h2>
      <p>
        Cloudflare processes technical information for hosting and, when
        enabled, Turnstile verification and abuse prevention. Google processes
        inquiry email through Google Workspace. The contact service does not
        store inquiries in a database. Application logs record operational
        errors without inquiry message bodies or email addresses.
      </p>
      <p>
        Learn more from{' '}
        <a
          class="text-link"
          href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Cloudflare’s privacy policy
        </a>{' '}
        and{' '}
        <a
          class="text-link"
          href="https://policies.google.com/privacy"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Google’s privacy policy
        </a>
        .
      </p>
      <h2>Retention and privacy questions</h2>
      <p>
        Inquiries may be retained in the company’s email system to respond and
        manage the related business conversation. The website does not
        automatically delete email conversations from that mailbox.
      </p>
      <p>
        For questions about your information or to request a correction or
        deletion, email contact@prathersoftware.com. This notice will be updated
        if the website’s data practices change.
      </p>
      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>
        Product stores and other linked services apply their own privacy
        policies. Following those links leaves this website.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .privacy-copy {
    max-width: 820px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .privacy-copy h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .privacy-copy h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
</style>
